---
import HangingMango from './HangingMango.astro';
---

<section class="how-it-works section">
  <HangingMango left="84%" wire={52} delay={1.4} />
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2>Describe. Explore. Lock it down.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps-grid reveal">

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-num">01</span>
        <h3>Describe</h3>
        <p>Give Kery a URL and an intent. No selectors, no page objects, no test setup.</p>
        <div class="step-snippet">
          <div class="snippet-line"><span class="snip-key">intent</span><span class="snip-sep">:</span> <span class="snip-val">"sign up, add a card, verify billing page"</span></div>
          <div class="snippet-line"><span class="snip-key">url</span><span class="snip-sep">:</span> <span class="snip-val">https://app.example.com</span></div>
          <div class="snippet-line"><span class="snip-key">auth</span><span class="snip-sep">:</span> <span class="snip-val">{"{ provider: \"clerk\" }"}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-num">02</span>
        <h3>Explore</h3>
        <p>Three agents run in sequence. <code>navigator</code> drives a real Chromium session with 15 action types. <code>reviewer</code> audits the full flow for state and behavioral gaps. <code>filmstrip</code> checks visual consistency across every screenshot.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-num">03</span>
        <h3>Lock it down</h3>
        <p><code>script_generator</code> compiles the navigator trace into a <code>.spec.ts</code> file. Every run after that replays it with zero LLM calls. If a selector drifts, <code>heal</code> corrects it from the accessibility tree and keeps going.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-it-works {
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .how-it-works h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .step-card {
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .step-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .step-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .step-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .step-card code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82em;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .step-snippet {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    background: #141816;
    border: 1px solid #2a302c;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .snippet-line {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .snip-key  { color: #e8b09a; }
  .snip-sep  { color: #6b756f; margin: 0 0.25rem; }
  .snip-val  { color: #9bc4a8; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
